            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the present paper, we introduce a new modification of Szász-Mirakyan operators based on [Formula: see text]-integers and investigate their approximation properties. We obtain weighted approximation and Voronovskaya-type theorem for new operators.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
